    "seq": 2,
    "toolResult": "\"**知识库：** guided-workflow-43b1c84c（group_id: `2938f8c8-6fee-44aa-a700-6aa8c9769c98`，已发布 MDL 版本：2）\\n\\n---\\nnl: 2025年有效订单销售额是多少？\\nsql: SELECT SUM(amount_cents) / 100 AS total_sales FROM \\\"order\\\" WHERE order_time >= DATE_TRUNC('year', DATE '2025-01-01')   AND order_time < DATE_TRUNC('year', DATE '2025-01-01') + INTERVAL 1 YEAR   AND status IN ('PAID', 'COMPLETED')   AND is_deleted = 0\\nsource: user\\nverified: true\\nvalidation_id: a064758e-2331-4709-ad09-d667b98fa8d4\\nmodel_hash: 30ff15e816360a24b3d1d289aa9fca1100c37e01c3e285b152ba1157fdbef76b\\nconfirmed_by: bob\\n---\\n\\n# 业务口径\\n\\n统计 2025 自然年（order_time 在 2025-01-01 00:00:00 至 2025-12-31 23:59:59 之间） 的有效订单销售额。有效订单指 status 为 PAID 或 COMPLETED、且 is_deleted = 0 的订单。 销售额为订单金额合计，amount_cents 单位为分，需除以 100 换算为元，不扣除退款， 不需要关联客户表。\\n\\n# SQL\\n\\n```sql\\nSELECT SUM(amount_cents) / 100 AS total_sales FROM \\\"order\\\" WHERE order_time >= DATE_TRUNC('year', DATE '2025-01-01')\\n  AND order_time < DATE_TRUNC('year', DATE '2025-01-01') + INTERVAL 1 YEAR\\n  AND status IN ('PAID', 'COMPLETED')\\n  AND is_deleted = 0\\n```\\n\\n请核对口径并重新查询；不得把示例当作固定答案。\""
  },
  {
    "type": "tool_result",
    "toolName": "wren_describe_model",
    "toolCallId": "call_01_IogX0wzPbPgNd0OOwIPJ7958",
